<title>USA: Smith Barney names Gray to head private banking.</title>
<headline>Smith Barney names Gray to head private banking.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Travelers Group Inc's Smith Barney unit said it named Stephen Gray as head of the private banking group at its investment banking division.</p>
<p>Gray joins the firm from Ironwood Capital Partners Ltd, where he was managing director.</p>
<p>Charlie Mather, who had the job previously, left the firm for Societe Generale.</p>
